@page "/privacy-policy"
@layout Layout.MainLayout

<SeoHead Title="Privacy Notice | Beldsoft" Description="How Beldsoft handles information submitted through this website." Path="/privacy-policy" />
<section class="page-hero compact"><div class="container narrow"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p class="lead">How information submitted through this website is used and protected.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container narrow legal-copy">
    <p><strong>Last updated: July 26, 2026</strong></p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2><p>When you request a consultation, Beldsoft collects the information you provide, which may include your name, organization, email address, phone number, service interest, contact preference, project description, and the page from which the request was submitted.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2><p>We use this information to evaluate and respond to your inquiry, communicate about potential services, maintain reasonable business records, prevent spam or abuse, and improve the website and consultation process.</p>
    <h2>How information is handled</h2><p>Submitted information is processed on the server and stored in access-controlled application storage. It is not intentionally written to application logs. Do not submit passwords, financial account information, health information, or other sensitive personal data through the form.</p>
    <h2>Sharing and retention</h2><p>Beldsoft may use service providers that support website hosting, communications, or business operations. Information should be retained only as long as reasonably necessary for the inquiry, legal obligations, security, and business records. Production retention periods and any third-party processors must be finalized before launch.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may request access, correction, or deletion of information associated with your inquiry, subject to applicable obligations. For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:privacy@beldsoft.com">privacy@beldsoft.com</a>.</p>
    <div class="legal-note"><strong>Business review required:</strong> Counsel should confirm the final legal entity name, governing jurisdiction, retention schedule, service providers, and any state-specific disclosures before production launch.</div>
</div></section>
